WEBVTT

00:06.420 --> 00:07.820
What's this?

00:07.820 --> 00:10.540
This is dark magic.

00:10.540 --> 00:12.060
Dark magic?

00:12.380 --> 00:15.120
Magic that turns people into demons with black Rukh.

00:15.120 --> 00:17.580
it is a terrible and very powerful magic.

00:18.040 --> 00:20.300
Why is this happening to them?

00:21.480 --> 00:24.080
This is a magic tool used to heal wounds.

00:27.840 --> 00:31.160
Stop making a mess of my dungeon!

00:31.160 --> 00:33.560
If it continues like this, they become demons for good!

00:33.560 --> 00:36.820
You should end this quickly with Baal's power!

00:37.760 --> 00:40.600
You're just a boy!

00:41.060 --> 00:42.770
He refused even after all we had done....

00:43.860 --> 00:45.650
Sinbad?

00:50.000 --> 00:51.030
Wha-What are you doing?

00:52.620 --> 00:55.110
I must save my friend.

00:56.280 --> 00:57.990
What are you talking about, dumb ass?

00:57.990 --> 01:00.560
If they become fully demon, we'll--

01:00.560 --> 01:01.490
Shut up.

01:02.380 --> 01:05.420
They said want to shape the world with me.

01:05.420 --> 01:07.880
You still think this monster is human?

01:07.880 --> 01:09.560
No!

01:09.560 --> 01:11.700
They are not man or monster.

01:12.160 --> 01:13.380
They are my comrades.

01:13.380 --> 01:16.140
I will not let my comrades die!

01:17.100 --> 01:19.260
You're always like this...

01:19.640 --> 01:21.700
You're not afraid ...?

01:21.700 --> 01:27.100
you cannot return to your country and you are searching...

01:27.100 --> 01:30.880
I don't follow my destiny.

01:31.610 --> 01:35.700
and so... I'm going to show that I can overcome my own destiny.

01:36.460 --> 01:39.910
Why do you fight to shape your destiny so much?

01:40.240 --> 01:42.920
How can you change it ?!

01:47.490 --> 01:50.910
2Nami Subs Presents: Magi: Sinbad no Bouken -Valefor Dungeon pt 2

02:00.640 --> 02:01.850
What's going on?

02:01.850 --> 02:03.470
This destructive power....

02:16.500 --> 02:19.120
What a time to break...

02:19.120 --> 02:21.370
Sinbad, use the power of the djinn!

02:22.020 --> 02:23.360
There is no other way!

02:23.360 --> 02:27.540
We either defeat them right now or we'll be killed!

02:27.540 --> 02:30.740
No, there is still another way.

02:30.740 --> 02:31.670
What?

02:31.670 --> 02:36.500
The monster's core is connected to the humans used to make it.

02:36.500 --> 02:39.800
and it seems like it's trying to drain their Magoi.

02:40.780 --> 02:43.100
The core of it is in the chest.

02:43.100 --> 02:47.810
If it can be destroyed with one blow, the three of them could be saved.

03:09.620 --> 03:10.210
Yes

03:12.210 --> 03:13.960
Bararaq-

03:14.140 --> 03:14.750
What?

03:27.500 --> 03:29.420
Hello, everyone.

03:29.840 --> 03:32.440
Without this, it seems you're powerless.

03:32.440 --> 03:34.440
The Falan witch!

03:38.220 --> 03:39.860
You're the one behind this!

03:42.280 --> 03:46.120
It's true, my real body is at Partevia.

03:46.120 --> 03:49.560
In fact, I'm under direct orders from Master Barbarossa.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.540
From my brother?

03:51.540 --> 03:54.340
Captain Dragul ...

03:54.340 --> 03:58.120
Pardon me, you were promoted two ranks again, you are now lieutenant.

03:58.120 --> 04:02.430
I climbed two ranks? What do you mean?

04:02.430 --> 04:07.280
This means you're already considered killed in action, Junior.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.220
That voice...

04:08.220 --> 04:09.780
Brother?

04:09.780 --> 04:13.840
Failed to conquer the dungeon, then ...

04:13.840 --> 04:17.230
... Failed to capture the dungeon conqueror, Sinbad.

04:17.230 --> 04:22.020
For someone of the famed Dragul family, this is unforgivable.

04:22.020 --> 04:23.240
And above all...

04:23.240 --> 04:25.440
... About my wife.

04:27.920 --> 04:34.120
Did you think I would not notice your feelings for Serendine?

04:35.700 --> 04:37.900
You crossed the line.

04:37.900 --> 04:40.060
She is my woman.

04:40.060 --> 04:43.380
Know your place, and die.

04:44.090 --> 04:47.510
You all were sent here as sacrificial pawns.

04:47.510 --> 04:50.220
You have nowhere to return to.

04:54.960 --> 04:56.230
Drakon.

04:59.220 --> 05:00.230
Hina!

05:02.580 --> 05:06.860
You should have immediately killed the demons with this sword.

05:07.820 --> 05:09.280
I told you already.

05:09.910 --> 05:11.740
I am not going to...

05:12.540 --> 05:14.080
... abandon anyone!

05:20.300 --> 05:21.750
Sinbad ...

05:22.140 --> 05:27.640
You always have been, overcome anything with a strong determination.

05:28.560 --> 05:33.420
I think if I had the power of a king, I could be like you.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.840
But now I understand.

05:35.840 --> 05:40.060
Even if I obtained the power of the king, I could not be like you.

05:40.060 --> 05:44.690
I'm just looking for an excuse to avoid mistakes.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.700
That's enough, Sinbad.

05:50.820 --> 05:52.490
I told you already ...

05:54.140 --> 05:56.870
... that's enough!

05:58.640 --> 05:59.500
Hina.

05:59.860 --> 06:03.630
Every time you're around, I end up getting my ass kicked.

06:04.320 --> 06:07.580
You're always underestimating me.

06:07.940 --> 06:10.620
When fighting the rampaging unicorn, you finished it off.

06:10.900 --> 06:13.980
You beat my opponents without even considering me.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.770
Even now ...

06:16.240 --> 06:19.760
My body is broken and  bruised

06:21.640 --> 06:23.040
But ...

06:23.820 --> 06:26.650
... You're an amazing guy.

06:26.650 --> 06:27.980
Yes.

06:29.520 --> 06:33.830
My destiny is to follow someone like him.

06:33.830 --> 06:36.380
Sin, I'll defeat him!

06:36.380 --> 06:39.460
I am the only one who can finish him off!

06:40.200 --> 06:44.670
Then, I'll keep him busy.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.880
With this I can get a direct hit!

06:49.760 --> 06:52.510
They are really annoying.

06:59.810 --> 07:00.560
What?

07:00.960 --> 07:04.480
This boy, he's somehow avoiding all the attacks!

07:04.480 --> 07:07.600
It's as if he can predict the attacks!

07:07.960 --> 07:08.440
In that case...

07:11.700 --> 07:12.910
Sinbad!

07:13.840 --> 07:15.490
Don't worry about me...

07:15.860 --> 07:16.910
But ...

07:16.910 --> 07:20.410
Do not move, we only have one shot at this!

07:22.080 --> 07:24.840
This need of yours to help others will get you killed.

07:27.880 --> 07:28.760
Die!

07:34.300 --> 07:35.180
Drakon.

07:38.000 --> 07:40.680
i was fighting for my country all this time.

07:40.680 --> 07:44.270
I used to think it was honorable, to die in battle for my country.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.400
But I was wrong.

07:46.700 --> 07:48.900
Who I should protect ...

07:49.260 --> 07:50.490
If you die, I will never forgive you!

07:50.980 --> 07:52.320
Barbarossa.

07:52.320 --> 07:54.490
I will not leave her to you!

07:54.490 --> 07:57.990
I will emerge from this dungeon, and...

07:57.990 --> 08:00.830
... Definitely will come to kill you!

08:03.920 --> 08:05.700
You come to your senses!

08:05.700 --> 08:08.800
Do you not see how shameful this is..

08:09.200 --> 08:10.970
... being under control of their magic?!

08:19.060 --> 08:21.850
What is going on?

08:29.500 --> 08:30.860
Sorry for keeping you waiting!

08:31.120 --> 08:35.360
This is the "First Spear" from the Imuchakk tribe!

08:35.610 --> 08:38.280
I'm not the old me.

08:38.700 --> 08:40.700
I am now sure ...

08:44.960 --> 08:46.580
... this will finish it!

09:00.280 --> 09:03.350
God damn it! How dare you kill my monster!

09:03.600 --> 09:05.350
You should join it!

09:10.520 --> 09:12.490
I believe this is mine.

09:18.460 --> 09:20.870
Still breathing, it seems he survived.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.800
You're awake?

09:26.780 --> 09:27.680
Oi.

09:28.260 --> 09:31.620
Sinbad, you saved us.

09:31.900 --> 09:33.170
Are you okay?

09:33.680 --> 09:38.920
Yes, I feel calm, as if an evil spirit had been separated from my body.

09:38.920 --> 09:41.060
Evil spirit??

09:42.560 --> 09:43.560
What?!

09:49.320 --> 09:50.920
Black rukh again...

09:50.920 --> 09:51.800
Boss!

09:51.800 --> 09:52.900
Impossible.

09:55.680 --> 09:57.350
The demon ...

09:57.350 --> 09:59.330
revived?!

10:01.870 --> 10:06.480
I can recreate it using a human corpse

10:06.480 --> 10:10.880
Plus, this child is already almost dead.

10:10.880 --> 10:13.960
These conditions are perfect for the finished core.

10:13.960 --> 10:16.740
What? Did they say "almost dead"?

10:16.740 --> 10:20.260
This time, the core is the child himself.

10:20.260 --> 10:26.180
Meaning to defeat the monster, you have to kill this child.

10:26.180 --> 10:28.440
Well, will you do?

10:34.340 --> 10:37.190
oi, what do you going to do?

10:37.190 --> 10:39.820
Maybe...

10:45.240 --> 10:48.080
He is trying to save him from inside?!

10:48.080 --> 10:51.520
Stop, the human body can not survive!

11:06.970 --> 11:08.840
What is this?

11:09.780 --> 11:12.160
It feels like it's flowing into my mind

11:13.780 --> 11:16.180
It is the memory of this child.

11:16.180 --> 11:20.320
Now we will go to the subconscious.

11:20.320 --> 11:21.280
Baal?

11:22.980 --> 11:27.620
My lord, I beg of you, save this child.

11:27.620 --> 11:32.580
He will not be able to return from the darkness that remains in this condition.

11:47.140 --> 11:49.020
It hurts...

11:49.720 --> 11:51.300
I don't want this...

11:53.040 --> 11:57.480
Mom ... Dad ...

12:02.800 --> 12:04.900
Where are you?

12:06.240 --> 12:07.410
Oi.

12:07.410 --> 12:11.540
Stop your whining, you're getting on my nerves!

12:13.200 --> 12:18.260
I don't wanna be here. I want to go home.

12:18.260 --> 12:20.740
Home? Do you even have a home?

12:20.740 --> 12:22.980
Quit being a fucking crybaby and face the music.

12:23.920 --> 12:28.640
We killed mother and father!

12:30.580 --> 12:32.520
Kill them, Jafar.

12:33.020 --> 12:34.020
Kill!

12:35.060 --> 12:38.260
We were born into the organization.

12:38.260 --> 12:41.420
One day,  we were required to kill them.

12:41.420 --> 12:44.910
So survive, we need to be strong!

12:48.100 --> 12:51.220
We had no other choice!

12:52.280 --> 12:53.790
There is no other choice...

12:56.380 --> 12:58.280
We had to kill them...

12:58.280 --> 13:01.080
we have to stay alive!

13:10.180 --> 13:13.810
So this is the real you.

13:14.800 --> 13:21.180
With this conflict in your heart, you're lying to yourself, and living in misery, huh?

13:21.180 --> 13:24.450
Shut up! What do you know ?!

13:25.800 --> 13:28.820
You're right, I do not know anything.

13:29.460 --> 13:30.280
But ...

13:33.500 --> 13:36.460
If you've got no place to go, I'll give you one.

13:37.020 --> 13:40.000
I will be the way by which you can keep moving.

13:40.000 --> 13:42.460
So do not lie to yourself anymore.

13:43.020 --> 13:44.970
Because in the end ...

13:45.900 --> 13:48.020
... you found your place.

13:56.760 --> 13:59.810
You heard me, didn't you?! I will not let my comrades die!

13:59.810 --> 14:03.190
Therefore, will not forgive you if you're dead.

14:05.900 --> 14:09.200
Huh? He received his own attack himself?

14:10.450 --> 14:11.450
Look!

14:12.020 --> 14:15.200
Black rukh is coming out of his body.!

14:19.740 --> 14:24.170
Not yet ... Do not give up yet, Jafar!

14:55.340 --> 14:57.920
Hey ...are you still alive?

15:00.740 --> 15:02.210
Yes.

15:04.210 --> 15:07.480
You really did it!

15:11.440 --> 15:13.680
I can not believe ...

15:13.680 --> 15:17.470
he could rescue people who fall into darkness.

15:17.470 --> 15:19.980
This boy...

15:25.600 --> 15:27.900
This treasure room ...

15:27.900 --> 15:33.490
is the place where the Djinn Valefor  will establish a contract with the King's Vessel.

15:33.490 --> 15:36.720
Well then, Choose who will become king!

15:43.320 --> 15:45.500
Sinbad, you're up!

15:46.860 --> 15:48.260
Hina.

15:48.660 --> 15:53.020
All the people here recognize you as king.

15:58.180 --> 16:02.520
Establish the contract with the Djinn, Sinbad, our king!

16:07.780 --> 16:12.420
I accept you as the king!

16:15.950 --> 16:18.230
Sixth Dungeon: Valefor

16:18.290 --> 16:21.400
Conquered!

16:32.160 --> 16:33.930
Looks like we're back.

16:34.860 --> 16:37.180
This time everything is in one place, yes.

16:37.700 --> 16:39.020
Very weird...

16:39.370 --> 16:42.280
Only a little time has passed since we entered the dungeon, however....

16:42.760 --> 16:45.540
it feels like ages ago.

16:45.940 --> 16:48.190
Welcome back!

16:59.460 --> 17:00.620
Father.

17:01.960 --> 17:02.960
I ...

17:04.580 --> 17:07.210
Well, let's go back to the village.

17:07.210 --> 17:09.480
The ceremony is about to begin!

17:11.200 --> 17:13.840
I will take leave from here.

17:13.840 --> 17:15.880
Wait, Drakon!

17:18.700 --> 17:21.600
Ultimately, we are rivals.

17:21.600 --> 17:24.600
Although we were allies in the dungeon,

17:24.600 --> 17:27.730
I have no reason to go with you.

17:29.600 --> 17:31.240
Why are you looking at me like that?!

17:31.240 --> 17:33.360
Nothing, no reason.

17:35.020 --> 17:36.740
You're not being sincere.

17:36.740 --> 17:40.360
Anyway, I'm going back to my country

17:40.360 --> 17:42.580
I am aware that it'll be dangerous.

17:42.580 --> 17:44.500
But despite everything in this place...

17:45.260 --> 17:47.750
... There is someone I have to protect.

17:49.900 --> 17:52.750
I understand. Good luck!

17:54.440 --> 17:57.010
Hopefully we do meet again.

18:06.180 --> 18:08.320
Sinbad ...

18:08.320 --> 18:12.320
If I were a man without a country, I would follow you as my king.

18:13.880 --> 18:15.730
No...I'd better not..

18:15.730 --> 18:19.320
Because if he is my master, my life would be full of problems.

18:21.940 --> 18:27.560
Kinzoku...It is an instrument that shines for Warriors...

18:27.560 --> 18:32.260
that have been blessed by the King and the djinn

18:33.060 --> 18:38.040
Drakon is the first to get this power.

18:38.040 --> 18:44.680
However, the story that uses this power is still there in the future.

18:47.100 --> 18:49.350
Yes, let's go home!

18:49.350 --> 18:51.360
Yeah!

18:58.300 --> 19:02.490
You are now a proud Imuchakk warrior,

19:02.490 --> 19:06.960
As evidence of this, I will now give you something special.

19:06.960 --> 19:09.020
Come close, warrior.

19:13.710 --> 19:18.180
Raging Unicorn horn is proof you're a warrior.

19:18.180 --> 19:22.140
This weapon is the symbol of justice.

19:22.140 --> 19:26.390
May your will be as strong as a million warriors.

19:26.390 --> 19:29.390
Warrior, your name is Hinahoho.

19:32.160 --> 19:41.160
The meaning of your new holy name is "clear like the ocean". Be an honorable warrior!

19:41.160 --> 19:42.660
Yes sir!

19:48.680 --> 19:49.660
Here.

19:56.640 --> 19:58.170
Boss.

19:58.170 --> 20:01.020
Cheers.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.360
Father!

20:06.180 --> 20:08.680
I mean, Elder.

20:09.180 --> 20:12.920
I will leave Imuchakk.

20:12.920 --> 20:16.690
I've decided...no, my destiny has decided

20:16.900 --> 20:20.650
To create a nation that unites the world!

20:21.500 --> 20:27.660
I want to be his sword, his hands, his shield. And achieve their dreams.

20:27.660 --> 20:32.060
I want to establish a new world along with Sinbad.

20:32.910 --> 20:35.920
You are now an Imuchakk warrior.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.880
I am proud of you.

20:38.940 --> 20:40.670
Yes.

20:54.020 --> 20:55.720
Grand Chief, Rametoto

20:55.720 --> 20:55.730
Grand Chef, Rametoto

20:55.730 --> 21:00.440
The warrior Hinahoho, thanks you for hearing us today.

21:01.900 --> 21:05.240
Warriors Hinahoho would would like to request the hand of Rurumo..

21:05.240 --> 21:10.420
in marriage, and to travel the world.

21:11.400 --> 21:15.650
Answer the question first, Warrior Hinahoho.

21:16.340 --> 21:20.320
What can you give to my daughter?

21:20.320 --> 21:23.520
Treasure? Power? Throne?

21:23.520 --> 21:29.260
My daughter has received a variety of my training in order to become the strongest warrior.

21:29.780 --> 21:32.780
He already has everything.

21:32.780 --> 21:37.770
What can you give to someone like her?

21:38.380 --> 21:42.900
There is nothing I can give her right away.

21:43.530 --> 21:49.030
Asshole, how dare you say such lowly things before the head of the federation!

21:49.030 --> 21:51.100
I'll rip you to pieces!

21:53.060 --> 21:57.290
I now can not give anything, but ...

21:57.290 --> 22:01.550
... I can share and realize her dream.

22:01.550 --> 22:03.630
The dream of my love!

22:06.960 --> 22:09.500
Through this conversation, Sinbad ...

22:09.500 --> 22:14.310
... Established a monopoly of trade contracts with Imuchakk.

22:14.310 --> 22:21.660
The name Sinbad the Conqueror spread to the world not only as an adventurer, but also as a merchant.

22:21.940 --> 22:24.320
The merchant fleet, which he founded,

22:24.920 --> 22:29.760
became known as the Sindria Trading Company of the Seven Seas!
